@startuml F5.11-D01-relatorios-secretaria
title F5.11-D01 — Relatórios da secretaria (cache MISS)
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam responseMessageBelowArrow true
skinparam maxMessageSize 220
autonumber

actor "Secretaria" as Sec
participant "WebApp" as WebApp
participant "JwtFilter" as Jwt
participant "ReportController" as Ctrl
participant "SecretaryReportUseCase" as UC
database "Postgres" as Postgres

Sec -> WebApp: /secretaria/estatisticas
WebApp -> Jwt: GET /reports/secretary
Jwt -> Ctrl: JWT ok
Ctrl -> UC: execute(...)
UC -> Postgres: 4 aggregations
Postgres --> UC: datasets
UC --> WebApp: 200
WebApp --> Sec: 4 gráficos

@enduml
